[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15421.11, "timestamp": "04:17:01", "text": "呃，要么是因为那栋建筑，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15424.389, "timestamp": "04:17:04", "text": "业主不允许，或者你住得太远了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15427.75, "timestamp": "04:17:07", "text": "他们身处高处，无法直接奔跑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15429.63, "timestamp": "04:17:09", "text": "一根电缆连接到你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15431.91, "timestamp": "04:17:11", "text": "除非你住在一楼，否则就不要住公寓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15434.55, "timestamp": "04:17:14", "text": "地板或其他什么东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15437.11, "timestamp": "04:17:17", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15440.63, "timestamp": "04:17:20", "text": "但你大概率会没事的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15443.349, "timestamp": "04:17:23", "text": "但愿如此。我看到了吗？我发给你了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15450.59, "timestamp": "04:17:30", "text": "呃，帮我拿一下东西？呃，稍等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15455.389, "timestamp": "04:17:35", "text": "日本。所以我的住处看起来会是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15464.07, "timestamp": "04:17:44", "text": "第二。是的，我可以复制这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15465.83, "timestamp": "04:17:45", "text": "好的，我会给你发张照片。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15468.189, "timestamp": "04:17:48", "text": "所以很容易从……进行检查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15471.04, "timestamp": "04:17:51", "text": "电话。好的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15473.59, "timestamp": "04:17:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15476.11, "timestamp": "04:17:56", "text": "呃，副本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15478.429, "timestamp": "04:17:58", "text": "和"}]